{"step_index":70,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-21T21:53:15Z","thinking":"**Analyzing Emoji Usage**\n\nI've begun examining the `index.html` file and discovered several instances of emojis. On line 47, there's \"⚡ Quick Interview Presets (1-Click Setup)\". Lines 52 and 60 also feature emojis: `⚡` and `🏗️` respectively. I'm noting each instance. I'm now moving on to the Javascript files to inspect emoji usage there.\n\n\n**Cataloging Emoji Findings**\n\nI've expanded my emoji inventory to include a wider range found in `index.html`, noting emojis like `💬`, `📄`, `🥷`, `📸`, and several others in the lines you specified. I've now moved on to analyze the usage of emojis within the JavaScript files, specifically `live-interview.js` and `preset-manager.js`, where I've identified numerous additional instances.\n\n\n**Compiling Emoji List**\n\nI'm now collating an extensive list of emojis within the codebase. I've recorded the statuses: `✅ Healthy`, `❌ Issues detected`, `❌ Preset Switch Failed`, and `🔄 Switching Model...`. I'm expanding into `screenshot-service.js`, cataloging numerous camera and vision-related emojis, as well as several failure symbols. I'm also analyzing `hotkeys.js` and `config-manager.js`, noting informational and success/failure emojis. Finally, I found a new one in `live-streaming.js`.\n\n\n**Documenting Visual Styles**\n\nI'm now documenting visual elements, starting with gradients, glows, and neon effects. In `main.css`, I've noted a mint gradient for the primary CTA button and glowing borders on `.pro-tip-card` elements, alongside indigo, emerald/mint, and amber/gold accent borders. I've also found a gradient on the `markdown-hr` element. I am now looking at visual components within the Javascript.\n\n\n\n**Detailing Visual Effects**\n\nI'm now documenting glows, shadows, and neon effects. In `main.css`, I've cataloged a purple-to-violet gradient on a component, a dark slate gradient on the `.code-block-container` at line 770, and indigo neon borders in `screenshot-service.js`. I am also cataloging several glow and shadow effects, including the border glow, accent glow, glassmorphism, and hover effects on buttons.\n\n\n**Identifying Visual Effects**\n\nI'm now focusing on a more granular analysis of visual elements, including glows, shadows, and animations. I've noted a green CTA button glow, healthy and unhealthy preset dot glows, and a notification shadow in `preset-manager.js`. I've documented neon cyan text selection and borders in `live-interview.css`, along with an amber border. I've also found neon cyan styles on headers and links in `markdown-styles.css`. Finally, I am looking at animations.\n\n\\n\\n\n\n**Uncovering Animation Styles**\n\nMy investigation has expanded to include animation and transition effects. I've identified several pulsing status indicators and dots in `live-interview.css` and `live-interview.js`. I've also found various typing and blinking cursor animations within `.streaming-text` elements in `live-interview.css`. Furthermore, I've logged word reveal effects, staggered transitions, and floating elements/overlays, like the cyan segments on a transparency feedback indicator from `hotkeys.css`.\n\n\n**Analyzing Layouts and Content**\n\nI'm now diving into the broader structure and content, noting the onboarding view with \"SPECTRA AI Interview Coach\". I see presets with badge pills (\"Ultra-Fast\", \"Architecture\"), and descriptive texts. The \"⚡ Demo\" button and \"💬 Brief & Human\" checkbox are noted. I'm seeing inconsistent naming (\"Aura\" vs. \"SPECTRA\") and CSS undefined variables, likely indicative of template stitching or AI-generated content.\n\n\n**Mapping Color Variables**\n\nI'm now focusing on color palette definitions within the CSS. I'm noting the `--panel` and `--silver` variables, along with semantic backgrounds for primary and secondary elements, text colors, and border styles. I'm also cataloging accents like blue, emerald/green, amber/warning, rose/error, and cyan, along with their variations. I'm expanding my analysis to include additional ad-hoc color injections, like indigo/purple, neon cyan/light blue, bright emerald/mint, bright amber/yellow, deep red, and a code theme.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"send_message","args":{"Message":"# Comprehensive Visual & UI Layer Research Report: Spectra\n\nThis report provides an in-depth breakdown of the visual and user interface layer of **Spectra** (`c:\\Users\\Arthur Henrique\\Documents\\GitHub\\Spectra\\web`), including view structure, CSS styles, JavaScript interactions, color palette, typography, and specific visual patterns that appear artificial, overly generic, or AI-generated.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Inventory of UI Views & Sections\n\nThe application is structured into three main full-page stages (`.view`), managed dynamically via CSS class `.active`:\n\n### Stage 1: Onboarding View (`#onboarding-view`)\n- **Brand Header & Hero**:\n  - `SPECTRA` logo with extreme letter-spacing (`0.22em`, 26px uppercase, 800 weight) and sub-tagline `\"AI Interview Coach\"` (`web/index.html#L27-L30`).\n  - Subtitle: *\"Set up your profile, AI preferences, and API credentials.\"*\n- **Tab Navigation Bar (`.tabs-nav`)**:\n  - 4 pill-style tabs: `1. Your Profile`, `2. AI Setup`, `3. Advanced Config`, `4. Commands & Tips`.\n- **Tab 1: Your Profile (`#profile-tab`)**:\n  - **Quick Presets Grid** (`.interview-presets-section`, `web/index.html#L45-L75`): 3 cards (\"Live Coding & DSA\", \"System Design\", \"Behavioral & HR\") featuring emoji icons (`⚡`, `🏗️`, `💬`) and pill badges (\"Ultra-Fast\", \"Architecture\", \"STAR Method\").\n  - **Candidate Profile Fieldset**: Inputs for `Name`, `Company`, `Target Role`, `Resume Textarea`, and a `\"📄 Upload PDF\"` file upload button + status text. Includes an inline `\"⚡ Demo\"` button in the fieldset legend (`web/index.html#L79-L80`).\n  - **Interview Focus Fieldset**: Checkbox grid (`Behavioral`, `System Design`, `DSA`, `Coding`, `Cultural Fit`, `HR / Screening`) and a highlighted standalone card checkbox for `💬 Brief & Human` (\"Senior-level answers in one natural paragraph\").\n  - **Job Description / Requirements Fieldset**: Multiline textarea for pasting job context.\n- **Tab 2: AI Setup (`#ai-setup-tab`)**:\n  - **AI Configuration**: Two-column layout for Primary AI Model and Secondary AI Model (Provider and Model `<select>` dropdowns), with a \"Quick Switch Hotkeys\" info card (`Alt+Q`, `Alt+W`, `Alt+E`).\n  - **Vision AI Configuration**: Primary & Secondary Vision Model dropdowns, plus a programming language checkbox grid (`Python`, `JavaScript`, `Java`, `C++`, `C#`, `Go`, `Rust`, `React or TypeScript`, `SQL`).\n- **Tab 3: Advanced Config (`#advanced-config-tab`)**:\n  - Deepgram API Key password input + Save button.\n  - Dynamic AI Providers table (`#adv-providers-list`) for managing multiple API keys per provider, adding rotating keys (`+`), removing keys (`×`), and testing connections.\n  - Large primary CTA: `\"Save All Provider Changes\"`.\n- **Tab 4: Commands & Pro-Tips (`#commands-tab`)**:\n  - 3 Callout Cards: `🥷 Stealth Professional Tip` (Indigo border), `📸 Multi-Screenshot Analysis` (Emerald border), `⚡ Speed Strategy` (Amber border).\n  - 4-column Keyboard Shortcuts cheat sheet: `🎭 Stealth & Appearance`, `🧠 AI Model Control`, `👁️ Vision AI Actions`, `🕹️ Interaction & Utils`.\n- **Bottom Action**: Big prominent CTA button `Proceed to Device Setup` (`#proceed-to-checks`).\n\n---\n\n### Stage 2: Pre-Flight Check View (`#preflight-view`)\n- **Container**: Centered glassmorphic card modal.\n- **Title**: `<h1>Aura Pre-Flight Check</h1>` *(Note the Aura/Spectra naming conflict)*.\n- **Checklist (`#checks`)**:\n  - Microphone Permission (`⚪ -> 🟢/🔴`)\n  - Microphone Selection device dropdown\n  - Backend Connection status\n  - Deepgram API validation\n  - Primary AI Provider status\n  - Dynamic rows for Secondary AI, Primary Vision, and Secondary Vision providers.\n- **Action Buttons**: `Back` (neutral gray) and `Start Interview` (vibrant emerald gradient `#34d399` -> `#10b981`).\n\n---\n\n### Stage 3: Live Interview Overlay View (`#live-view`)\n- **Container**: Full-screen transparent/translucent overlay (`position: fixed; inset: 0; backdrop-filter: blur(10px)`).\n- **Header Bar (`.live-header`)**:\n  - Status indicator: Pulsing white/recording dot + `\"Live Interview Session\"`.\n  - Dynamically injected AI Model indicator (`#preset-indicator` from `web/js/preset-manager.js#L28-L45`) showing current active model, provider, glowing status dot, and hotkey hints.\n  - Controls: `🎤 Mute` (toggles to red muted state), `Reset` (amber border), `End Interview` (translucent red/gray).\n- **Conversation Stream (`#conversation-stream`)**:\n  - Scrollable chat container with custom bubble styling:\n    - **Interviewer Bubbles**: Left-aligned, cyan-tinted border/background (`rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.06)`), small uppercase label `🎤 Interviewer`.\n    - **Candidate Bubbles**: Right-aligned, neutral white/gray glassmorphic bubble, label `👤 Candidate`.\n    - **AI Response**: Full-width card with green left-border (`rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.5)`), label `🤖 AI Assistant`, response metadata tags (`🧠 model-name`, `🔄 Backup used`, `⚠️ Error`), and syntax-highlighted code blocks with copy buttons.\n    - **Vision AI Analysis**: Purple gradient (`linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.05) 0%, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.05) 100%)`) with label `👁️ Vision AI Analysis`.\n- **Activity Indicator (`#activity-indicator`)**:\n  - Floating pill overlay at bottom-center: Pulsing dot + `\"Listening...\"`, `\"🔇 Microphone Muted\"`, or `\"⏸️ System Paused\"`.\n- **Dynamic Floating Overlays**:\n  - Floating Resume Scroll Button (`.resume-scroll-btn`, `web/js/live-interview.js#L178`): Circular button with pulsating green alert when new content arrives.\n  - Vision Mode Center Modal (`#vision-mode-indicator`, `web/js/screenshot-service.js#L213-L277`): Big pop-up in center of screen with glowing purple border `👁️ Vision Mode Active (Global)`.\n  - Screenshot Queue Tray (`#screenshot-queue`, `web/js/screenshot-service.js#L81-L166`): 2-column image preview grid anchored at top-right.\n  - Toast Notifications (`.preset-notification`, `.capture-notification`, `#transparency-feedback`): Floating toasts slide in from top/bottom-right with accent border strips.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Color Palette & Typography\n\n### Complete Color Palette\n\n| Category | Token / Variable | Hex / RGBA | Usage |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Neutrals** | `--pure-black` | `#08090d` | Base darkest black |\n| | `--pure-white` | `#f3f4f8` | Base text / crisp elements |\n| | `--charcoal` | `#0e0f14` | Secondary dark background |\n| | `--steel-gray` | `#15171f` | Component borders / tracks |\n| | `--slate-panel` | `#1b1d27` | Elevated card layers |\n| | `--silver` | `#e2e4ea` | Light neutral text/accents |\n| | `--light-gray` | `#a2a5b5` | Subtitles, hints |\n| **Semantic Backgrounds** | `--bg-primary` | `#090a0e` | Main page background |\n| | `--bg-secondary` | `#111218` | Select inputs, scrollbar tracks |\n| | `--bg-tertiary` | `#171821` | Pill tab track, pro-tip keycaps |\n| | `--bg-card` | `#14151e` | Inputs, cards, options |\n| | `--bg-glass` | `rgba(13, 14, 20, 0.92)` | Container glassmorphism |\n| **Semantic Text** | `--text-primary` | `#f0f1f6` | Primary headings, inputs |\n| | `--text-secondary` | `#9093a3` | Secondary text, hints, labels |\n| | `--text-muted` | `#5e6172` | Brand tagline, disabled items |\n| **Primary Accents** | `--accent-blue` / `--accent-primary` | `#3b82f6` | Primary buttons, active tabs, focus ring |\n| | `--accent-blue-light` | `#60a5fa` | Hover state on buttons |\n| | `--accent-emerald` / `--accent-success` | `#10b981` | Success states, valid input border |\n| | `--accent-amber` / `--accent-warning` | `#f59e0b` | Secondary models, warning badges |\n| | `--accent-rose` | `#f43f5e` | Errors, remove buttons |\n| | `--accent-cyan` | `#0ea5e9` | Interviewer dialogue accents |\n| **AI Accent Colors (Ad-Hoc / Injected)** | AI Indigo | `#6366f1` / `#818cf8` | Vision AI headers, pro tips, focus tags |\n| | AI Violet | `#8b5cf6` | Vision gradient backdrop |\n| | Neon Cyan | `#64d2ff` / `rgba(0, 212, 255, 0.3)` | Selection color, approach headers, links |\n| | Bright Mint | `#34d399` | Start Interview button gradient start |\n| | Bright Amber | `#ffc107` / `#fbbf24` | Reset button, complexity metrics, speed tip |\n| | Code Theme Background | `#1e2128` / `#1a202c` / `#2d3748` | Prism/Code container gradients |\n\n### Typography\n\n- **Primary Sans-Serif Family**: `'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif` (loaded via Google Fonts at `web/index.html#L14`).\n- **Code & Monospace Family**: `'JetBrains Mono', 'Fira Code', 'SF Mono', 'Monaco', 'Menlo', 'Ubuntu Mono', monospace` (`--font-mono`).\n- **Type Scale**:\n  - `--font-xs`: `12px` (badges, hints, metadata, command keys)\n  - `--font-sm`: `13px` (subtitles, standard inputs, table cells)\n  - `--font-base`: `15px` (body copy)\n  - `--font-lg`: `19px` (section headers, dialog headings)\n  - `--font-xl`: `22px` (main modal headings)\n  - `--font-2xl`: `28px` (brand title)\n\n---\n\n## 3. Specific \"AI-Generated\" / Artificial UI Elements\n\nThe visual layer exhibits numerous tell-tale markers of generic AI code generation, LLM template mixing, and overly decorative \"hype\" UI patterns:\n\n### A. Excessive Gradients, Glows & Neon Accent Strips\n1. **CTA Start Button Neon Glow**:\n   - **File**: `web/css/main.css#L1039-L1047`\n   - **Code**: `background: linear-gradient(135deg, #34d399, #10b981); box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.35); transform: translateY(-2px);`\n   - **Issue**: Standard \"AI SaaS mint green gradient\" with a diffuse colored glow.\n2. **Vision Analysis Multi-Color Gradient Card**:\n   - **File**: `web/js/live-interview.js#L579`\n   - **Code**: `background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.05) 0%, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.05) 100%); border-left: 4px solid #6366f1;`\n   - **Issue**: Purple-to-violet linear gradient background with indigo border.\n3. **Neon Cyan Text Selection & Links**:\n   - **File**: `web/css/live-interview.css#L665`, `web/css/markdown-styles.css#L427`, `web/css/markdown-styles.css#L702`\n   - **Code**: `::selection { background: rgba(0, 212, 255, 0.3); }`, `.markdown-link { color: rgba(100, 210, 255, 0.9); }`\n   - **Issue**: High-saturation neon cyan glow for selections and links.\n4. **Health Status Glowing Neon Dots**:\n   - **File**: `web/js/preset-manager.js#L105-L113`\n   - **Code**: `.preset-health-dot.healthy { box-shadow: 0 0 4px rgba(72, 187, 120, 0.4); }` and `.unhealthy { box-shadow: 0 0 4px rgba(245, 101, 101, 0.4); }`\n   - **Issue**: Tiny glowing neon dots added to an already busy header.\n\n---\n\n### B. Generic Emoji Overload in Labels, Cards & Controls\nAlmost every label, button, and header is prepended with a generic emoji:\n- **`web/index.html`**:\n  - Line 47: `⚡ Quick Interview Presets (1-Click Setup)`\n  - Line 52, 60, 68: Preset card icons `⚡`, `🏗️`, `💬`\n  - Line 80: `<button id=\"fill-demo-btn\">⚡ Demo</button>`\n  - Line 87: `📄 Upload PDF`\n  - Line 107: `💬 Brief & Human`\n  - Line 260: `🥷 Stealth Professional Tip`\n  - Line 266: `📸 Multi-Screenshot Analysis`\n  - Line 272: `⚡ Speed Strategy`\n  - Line 280, 291, 301, 311: `🎭 Stealth & Appearance`, `🧠 AI Model Control`, `👁️ Vision AI Actions`, `🕹️ Interaction & Utils`\n  - Line 368: `<span class=\"mute-icon\">🎤</span>`\n- **`web/js/live-interview.js`**:\n  - Line 508, 511, 514: `🎤 Interviewer`, `👤 Candidate`, `🤖 AI Assistant`\n  - Line 538: `👁️ Vision AI Analysis`\n  - Line 1062: `🤖 Thinking...`\n  - Line 1162, 1169, 1176: `🧠 ${modelName}`, `🔄 Backup used`, `⚠️ Error`\n- **`web/js/screenshot-service.js`**:\n  - Line 33: `📸 Screenshots Queue`\n  - Line 213: `👁️ Vision Mode Active (Global)`\n  - Line 475: `📸 Screenshot Captured (Global)`\n  - Line 512: `🗑