 `preset-manager.js:106` | Saturated glowing green CTA buttons, purple gradients, and neon cyan selections. |\n| **Emoji Pollution** | High | `index.html:47-311`, `live-interview.js:508`, `screenshot-service.js:213` | Over 30+ emoji icons used as bullet points, headers, card icons, and toast badges. |\n| **Excessive Animations** | Medium | `live-interview.css:101, 669`, `markdown-styles.css:358`, `live-interview.js:227` | Constant pulsing dots, blinking cursors on completed items, and 20ms staggered list reveals. |\n| **Injected Stylesheets** | High | `live-interview.js`, `preset-manager.js`, `screenshot-service.js` | 5+ runtime `<style>` injections containing duplicated styles and hardcoded hex colors. |\n| **Broken CSS Tokens** | Low | `main.css:690, 724, 1332, 1386` | Undefined variables like `--subtle-purple` and `--accent-indigo` used across rules. |\n","Recipient":"bbca0f09-2535-4f26-97c1-b43b75148a4f","toolAction":"Sending research report","toolSummary":"Report UI layer findings to caller"}}]}
